      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Of the Winnipeg homes tested in the 2024 Cross-Canada survey, 37.4% came in at or above Health Canada's 200 Bq/m3 guideline. A long-term test through the heating season is the only way to know where yours sits.</p>
